%%{init: {'themeVariables': {'noteBkgColor': '#E8E8E8', 'noteBorderColor': '#999999', 'noteTextColor': '#1a1a1a'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Traveler
    participant W as Web App (Frontend)
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant IdP as Appwrite Auth
    participant Pay as Payment Gateway (planned: UPI, coming soon)
    participant Store as Appwrite Storage
    actor P as Storage Partner

    Note over T,DB: Discovery (DFD P2)
    T->>W: Search storage (list or map)
    activate W
    W->>API: GET /listings?city=
    activate API
    API->>DB: Query available listings (D2)
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: Matching listings
    deactivate DB
    API-->>W: Available storage options
    deactivate API
    W-->>T: Display storage options
    deactivate W

    Note over T,DB: Login (DFD P1)
    T->>W: Log in to continue booking
    activate W
    W->>IdP: Create email session (Appwrite SDK)
    activate IdP
    IdP-->>W: Session + JWT
    deactivate IdP
    W->>API: GET /auth/me (Bearer JWT)
    activate API
    API->>IdP: Verify JWT, identify account
    activate IdP
    IdP-->>API: Account identity
    deactivate IdP
    API->>DB: Load profile and role (D1)
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: User profile
    deactivate DB
    API-->>W: User profile + role
    deactivate API
    W-->>T: Logged in
    deactivate W

    Note over T,DB: Booking, cash on pickup (DFD P31, P32)
    T->>W: Select partner, time slot, confirm booking
    activate W
    W->>API: POST /bookings (Bearer JWT, payment = cash)
    activate API
    API->>DB: Validate slot, opening hours and price quote (P31)
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: Availability confirmed
    deactivate DB
    API->>DB: Lock listing, re-check capacity, create booking as Booked (P32)
    activate DB
    API->>DB: Update listing availability (D2)
    DB-->>API: Booking record saved
    deactivate DB
    Note right of API: Cash on pickup: nothing is charged at booking.<br/>The OTP and QR are derived from the booking.
    Note over API,Pay: Planned: online UPI/card capture before Booked (coming soon)
    API-->>W: Booking confirmation + QR/OTP
    deactivate API
    W-->>T: Show booking ID and QR/OTP
    deactivate W

    Note over T,P: Drop-off handoff (DFD P33, P34)
    T->>P: Present check-in QR/OTP
    P->>API: POST /partner/bookings/{id}/check-in (OTP or QR)
    activate API
    API->>DB: Match handoff details against booking (P33)
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: Handoff verified
    deactivate DB
    API-->>P: Handoff verified
    deactivate API
    P->>API: POST /partner/bookings/{id}/drop-off (photos)
    activate API
    API->>Store: Save photos in private bucket
    activate Store
    Store-->>API: File IDs
    deactivate Store
    API->>DB: Record drop-off, set status = Stored (P34)
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: Drop-off recorded
    deactivate DB
    API-->>P: Drop-off confirmed
    deactivate API
    API-->>T: Notify: luggage stored

    Note over T,P: Pickup & cash collection (DFD P35, P4)
    T->>P: Present retrieval QR/OTP
    P->>API: POST /partner/bookings/{id}/pickup (OTP or QR)
    activate API
    API->>DB: Verify pickup details against booking (P35)
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: Pickup verified
    deactivate DB
    API->>DB: Record cash collected, final price (incl. overstay), 15% fee, mark Completed (P4)
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: Booking and payment updated
    deactivate DB
    Note right of API: Partner keeps the cash, the platform fee<br/>is settled later by an admin (fee_settlements).
    API-->>P: Pickup confirmed + fee recorded
    deactivate API
    API-->>T: Booking completed, request rating

    T->>W: Submit post-pickup rating
    activate W
    W->>API: POST /bookings/{id}/rating
    activate API
    API->>DB: Store rating
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: Rating saved
    deactivate DB
    API-->>W: Rating recorded
    deactivate API
    W-->>T: Thank you for your feedback
    deactivate W
